				varmap 100% "branch = \"TU5\", contextComment = \"(100%) User option\", enabled = true, guid = #49D82446671F5682000553EB70B678CB, lineVersion = 4, maxLength = 0, productId = -1, sectionId = 11203, text = \"100%\", type = \"MenuLine\""
